2.
Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires:-
(a)
"article" means article of the Constitution;
(b)
"Chairperson" means the Chairperson of the Commission;
(c)
"Commission" means the National Commission for Scheduled Tribes established under Article 338-A;
(d)
"Member" means a Member of the Commission;
(e)
the expression "Scheduled Tribes" shall have the meaning assigned to it in clause (25) of Article 366;
(f)
"Vice-Chairperson" means the Vice-Chairperson of the Commission.
